  "instructions": [
    "Combine yeast, flour, and salt in a bowl.",
    "Gradually add water to the bowl and mix until a smooth batter forms.",
    "Add sliced cabbage, scallions, and mushrooms to the batter and mix well.",
    "Heat a large cast-iron skillet or okonomiyaki pan over medium heat.",
    "Add 1 tablespoon of sesame oil to the pan and swirl it around.",
    "Pour half of the batter into the pan and spread it evenly.",
    "Add sliced duck breast, bamboo shoots, and okonomiyaki sauce to the batter and mix well.",
    "Pour the remaining batter over the duck and vegetables.",
    "Cook for 3-4 minutes or until the bottom is golden brown.",
    "Loosen the edges of the okonomiyaki with a spatula and flip it over.",
    "Cook for another 3-4 minutes or until the other side is also golden brown.",
    "Serve hot with additional okonomiyaki sauce and soy sauce if desired."
  ],
